title: A file deleted while it has unsaved text stays deleted: closing does not ask to save it and Save and close does not write it back
folders: edit-odd
limit: 50
absent-file: edit-odd/a.txt
expect-file: edit-odd/b.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of b

wait 3000
left files
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
type MINE
delete a.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 3500
mark deleted
wait 400
quit
wait 1000
mark closing
wait 400
answer Save and close
wait 800
